{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BankFeedProviders\">Bank Feed Providers</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Automatic Bank_account BankAccount BankFeedProvider BankFeedProviders By Count On Port Support To ToDate\"><em>Bank feed providers</em> are financial institutions or data aggregators who support the Financial Data Exchange (FDX) standard. By setting up bank feed providers, you can enable automatic bank feeds for your bank accounts.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"\">Getting Started</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"BankFeedProvider BankFeedProviders On Settings To ToDate\">To access the <em>Bank Feed Providers</em> screen, go to the <strong>Settings</strong> tab, then click <strong>Bank Feed Providers</strong>.</p><div class=\"flex pointer-events-none space-x-6 rtl:space-x-reverse items-center\"><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-cog text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Settings\">Settings</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><span class=\"rtl:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-right text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><span class=\"ltr:hidden\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-chevron-left text-lg text-neutral-300\"></i></span><div class=\"border rounded inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"basis-72 flex items-center gap-2 p-4\"><i class=\"text-xl text-neutral-400 fas fa-fw fa-building-columns\"></i><span class=\"text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BankFeedProviders\">Bank Feed Providers</span></span></div></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Add BankFeedProvider NewBankFeedProvider On To ToDate\">To add a new bank feed provider, click the <strong>New Bank Feed Provider</strong> button.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"BankFeedProviders\">Bank Feed Providers</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewBankFeedProvider\">New Bank Feed Provider</span></span></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Bank_account BankAccount Count On\">Connecting Bank Accounts</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts And Bank_account BankAccount BankFeedProvider Count Is On To ToDate View\">Once you have at least one bank feed provider defined, go to the <strong>Bank & Cash Accounts</strong> tab and click on the <strong>View</strong> button for the bank account you wish to connect to a bank feed provider.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><span class=\"bg-white font-semibold border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-700 rounded py-2 px-4\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"ConnectToBankFeedProvider\">Connect to Bank Feed Provider</span></span></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action On Transaction Transactions\">Retrieving Transactions</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts Action Bank_account BankAccount BankFeedProvider CheckForNewTransactions Count Name On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Once you have at least one bank account connected to a bank feed provider, under the <strong>Bank & Cash Accounts</strong> tab at the bottom, you will see a new button named <strong>Check for New Transactions</strong>.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 text-neutral-900 p-8 text-sm\"><span class=\"bg-white font-semibold border border-neutral-300 text-neutral-700 rounded py-2 px-4\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"CheckForNewTransactions\">Check for New Transactions</span></span></div></div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Action And Bank_account BankAccount BankFeedProvider Count Is On To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">Clicking this button will connect to the <em>bank feed provider</em> for each bank account and attempt to retrieve the latest transactions.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"On\">Regional Information</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business Businesses Off On To ToDate\">If you are in Australia, Manager.io has partnered with Basiq.io to offer free bank feeds to Australian businesses. Go to https://basiq.manager.io for more information.</p>",
  "key": "bank-feed-providers"
